-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party references and their licenses
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

nano/messages.py, nano/records.py, nano/dumps.py
  The System Exclusive frame layout, the Alesis manufacturer and family
  IDs, the function codes, the record sizes, the 8-into-7 bit packing and
  the seven-bit name encoding are transcribed as data, and in part
  derived, from:

    Alesis QS6/QS7/QS8/QSR System Exclusive Specification, Alesis Corp.
    System Exclusive dumps produced by the instrument itself

nano/banks.py
  The five banks, their Bank Select values, the sixteen front-panel
  categories and the hardwired silent program are transcribed as data
  from:

    Ensoniq SQ-R Plus Reference Manual, Alesis Corp., 1998

nano/bridge.py, nano/favorites.py, nano/config.py, nano/catalog.py
  Ported from the sibling projects x5ded, kwsed, p2ked, rxved, s3ked and
  k2kremote, which are under the same licence.

  Facts and interface data, transcribed for interoperability. None of those
  documents is redistributed here.

